    "节拍器无需注册账户。节拍设置和曲目预设存储在设备上。购买和订阅由 Apple 处理，节拍器通过 StoreKit 确认购买权益。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No account is required. Metronome settings and song presets are stored on your device. Apple processes purchases and subscriptions. The app uses StoreKit to verify access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節拍器無需註冊帳號。節拍設定和曲目預設儲存在裝置上。購買與訂閱由 Apple 處理，節拍器透過 StoreKit 確認購買權益。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
